    "description": "<p><strong>Ongoing.</strong> A nearby creature is held immobile in an unbreakable forcefield. While the Spell is Ongoing the caged creature cannot be harmed and can detect your thoughts. You cannot leave sight of the cage or it will vanish.<br><br><em>Risk:</em> You cannot act while the Spell is Ongoing (besides dismissing it).<br><em>Greater:</em> The cage is large enough to also encompass those within a few paces of the target.</p>",
